A group of refugees broke through the border.
Behind it, a police line had formed and behind the policemen a water cannon was ready.
40 to 50 refugees began throwing stones, sticks and sculpted plastic bottles at the officers.
Officers initially used pepper spray uninterrupted.
After that, the police used tear gas.
A lot of tear gas was sprayed towards the refugees.
Thus, the group was dissolved.
Refugees have now withdrew a bit.
A pregnant and apparently injured woman was carried away from the zone.
