The low-cost airline Eurowings should be developed as independently as possible.
In the management team led by CEO Carsten Spohr, Karl Ulrich Garnadt will be responsible for Eurowings in the future.
With the renewing, Spohr underscores the importance of Eurowings, with which the Group intends to compete against Ryanair and Easyjet in the future.
