The England defender has an additional incentive to recover by next June with the European Championship in France.
Phillip Cocu, the PSV coach, said: "It's a very bad injury."
If a player with this type of injury leaves the pitch, everyone is very sad about it.
It's never the intention of our players to hurt an opponent.
Moreno suffered a leg fractury when Mexico played against Van Gaal's Holland squad at the 2014 World Cup.
"He's having a very hard time because it wasn't his intention to hurt the opponent, and then if you hear it's a very bad injury, that's not good," Cocu said.
It wasn't possible for me to see the moment.
