He's one of the nicest guys of the game who's going to bring a wealth of experience as he's played in all conditions and against all the attacks.
Paul Collingwood arrives for the tour's white ball phase and brings energy and a powerful effort into the setup.
I've always felt he's created for the international cricket competition, as a player or as a coach, and like Mahela he has insights from which we can benefit.
