Ex-footballer Tim Wiese has been unwellowed in Bremen.
Footballer was once, meanwhile Tim Wiese, ex-national goalkeeper in Germany and at Bremen and Hoffenheim, wrestler.
According to his own statement, he has gained 30 kilograms of muscle mass in the past two years.
Intellectually, on the other hand, it has not increased.
Wiese was just getting his hair cut in Bremen's city centre when he saw how outside, a parking-room attendant issued a ticket for his white chevrolet Camaro.
Wiese then stormed out of business, insulted the civil servant and threw the due fine at her feet, as the "Bild" newspaper reports.
The city of Bremen confirms the accusations, but it is not yet clear about the consequences for the unusual incident.
