They used to be one of the best teams in baseball, today the Tigers are in last place in the American League Central.
The Tigers are reduced to their role as spoilers, but played this game perfectly against the Minnesota Twins with 5-4 at Target Field on Tuesday.
The Twins wasted a chance to rise within one-half of the Houston Astros' second American League wild-card place.
For Detroit, if only for one evening, it was a return of the three-letter F-word that was so easy to comprehend over much of the second half of the season.
